，一定还有别的办法，我说什么也不要再失去你！”夏寒轩紧紧拥她入怀，痛心不已，那双桃花眼底满是纠结。三年前，媚儿死了，他曾以为这辈子都不可再拥她入怀了，却不曾想，有一天她又奇迹般地活了过来，他再也无法接受失去她的痛苦！只是，他并不知道，此媚儿非彼媚儿，那个媚儿注定不能回来了，而这个媚儿，他注定不能拥有！“寒轩哥哥！这就是现实，强者无敌，如果有一天，你强了，你还可以把我抢回来，可是，现在，你根本没办法跟商离天抢！”媚儿字字句句直击夏寒轩最不愿意面对的心房。“媚儿……”夏寒轩望着近在咫尺的媚儿，忽然生出一股邪念，他现在不能娶她，可他也不甘心让她做别人的女人，他要做她的第一任男人！媚儿蓦然感应到他的邪念，暗暗蹙眉，这个男人还真是该死，居然想玷污她，难道他不知道商离天那个贱男人最恨的就是不干净的女人吗？想当初，伍辰儿就是因为……“媚儿，我要你永远记得我！”夏寒轩略吸一口气，突然将媚儿压到地上，大手迫不及待地朝她衣领伸去！“寒轩哥哥，你要干什么……”媚儿故作惊吓状，其实，以她的身手，要出其不易地置夏寒轩于死地，那简直是易如反掌，不过，现在，这个男人还有用处，所以不能让他死。“媚儿，我爱你！我要让你永远都记住我！”夏寒轩激动异常，紧抓着媚儿小手不放。商离天利用权势夺他爱的女人，他也要让商离天取一个他要过的女人！“寒轩哥哥，你不可以这样对我……”媚儿正要出手制止，不过，却听到那熟悉的脚步声传来，她知道，小仙带的人到了，所以故意叫得很大声。“逆子！你在做什么？”西夏王在小仙的搀扶下出现在门口，看到自己儿子如此的行径，气得差点没吐老血。“父王……”西夏王这一声怒喝终于让夏寒轩停止了所有的动作，心不甘情不愿地站了起来，并尴尬地整理着自己的衣物。“圣女！”小仙连忙跑过来将媚儿扶了起来，两人暗中互换了一下眼神。“大王……”媚儿边整理着有些凌乱的衣物，声音委屈至极，满含泪花的望着西夏王。“逆子！”西夏王抬手啪地给了夏寒轩一个清脆的耳光，尽管他知道以媚儿的身手，他的儿子绝对不是她的对手。可是，一想到自己居然生出一个如此不顾大局的儿子，他还是很生气。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "First, she could not bear the hatred of genocide, but Meier remained calm and persuaded softly: \"Brother Hanxuan, Meier was wrongly loved by you. However, now that the enemy is strong and I am weak, we can't fight head-on with the Shang Kingdom. If I can sacrifice my own happiness in exchange for the peace of the people of Xixia, I am really willing!\" These words were gentle and touching, and Xia Hanxuan's heart was filled with tenderness! He held Mei'er upright and stared into her beautiful eyes. She looked so pitiful with tears in her eyes. How could he be willing to give her up? \"Mei'er, there must be another way. I won't lose you again no matter what I say!\" Xia Hanxuan hugged her tightly, heartbroken, and her peach blossom eyes were full of tangles. Three years ago, Meier died. He thought he would never be able to hold her in his arms again in this life, but he never thought that one day she would miraculously come back to life, and he could no longer accept the pain of losing her! However, he didn't know that this Meier was not that Meier. That Meier was destined not to come back, and he was destined not to have this Meier! \"Brother Han Xuan! This is reality, the strong are invincible. If one day, you are strong, you can take me back, but now, there is no way you can take me back with Shang Litian!\" Meier's words hit the heart of Xia Hanxuan that she least wanted to face. \"Mei'er...\" Xia Hanxuan looked at Mei'er who was so close, and suddenly had an evil thought. He couldn't marry her now, but he was not willing to let her be someone else's woman. He wanted to be her first man! Mei'er suddenly sensed his evil thoughts and frowned secretly. This man really deserves to die, he actually wants to taint her. Doesn't he know that Shang Litian, that bitch man, hates unclean women the most? I think back then, it was because of Wu Chen'er... \"Mei'er, I want you to remember me forever!\" Xia Hanxuan took a breath, suddenly pressed Mei'er to the ground, and stretched his big hands towards her collar impatiently! \"Brother Hanxuan, what are you going to do...\" Meier pretended to be frightened. In fact, with her skills, it would be easy to kill Xia Hanxuan. However, now, this man is still useful, so he cannot be allowed to die. \"Meier, I love you! I want you to remember me forever!\" Xia Hanxuan was extremely excited and held Meier's little hand tightly. Shang Litian used his power to take away the woman he loved, and he also wanted to let Shang Litian take the woman he wanted! \"Brother Hanxuan, you can't do this to me...\" Meier was about to stop her, but she heard the familiar footsteps. She knew that the people brought by Xiaoxian had arrived, so she deliberately shouted loudly. \"Son! What are you doing?\" The King of Xixia appeared at the door with the support of Xiaoxian. Seeing his son's behavior, he was so angry that he almost vomited blood. \"Father...\" The angry shout from the King of Xixia finally made Xia Hanxuan stop all his movements, stood up reluctantly, and arranged his clothes awkwardly. \"Saint!\" Xiaoxian quickly ran over and helped Meier up, and the two secretly exchanged glances. \"Your Majesty...\" Mei'er said in an aggrieved voice as she sorted out some messy clothes, looking at the King of Xixia with tears in her eyes. \"You traitor!\" The King of Xixia raised his hand and gave Xia Hanxuan a crisp slap in the face, even though he knew that with Meier's skills, his son was definitely no match for her. However, he was still very angry when he thought that he had given birth to a son who was so indifferent to the overall situation.", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}